sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor P as Person
    participant Sh as Shell in pane (ptyd)
    participant C as claude
    participant H as terminescu hook
    participant Co as Rust core
    participant W as Window (webview)

    P->>Sh: types claude
    Sh->>C: starts with TERMINESCU_PANE_ID in env
    C->>H: SessionStart (session_id, transcript_path)
    H->>Co: hook JSON + pane id over unix socket
    H-->>C: writes eval "$(terminescu var env)" to CLAUDE_ENV_FILE, exit 0
    Co->>W: patch: pane has agent icon
    P->>C: prompt
    C->>H: UserPromptSubmit
    H->>Co: forward
    Co->>W: patch: Running
    C->>H: PermissionRequest (Bash)
    H->>Co: forward
    Co->>W: patch: Waiting, amber side tab, count +1
    Co-->>P: macOS notification if the app is in the background
    P->>W: ⌘⇧A focuses the oldest waiting pane
    P->>C: approves
    C->>H: PostToolUse
    H->>Co: forward
    Co->>W: patch: Running, amber clears
    C->>H: Stop (last_assistant_message)
    H->>Co: forward
    Co->>W: patch: Done
